<procedure><preliminaryRqmts><reqCondGroup><reqCondNoRef><reqCond>The hydraulic power unit is stopped and electrically isolated.</reqCond></reqCondNoRef></reqCondGroup><reqSupportEquips><noSupportEquips/></reqSupportEquips><reqSupplies><supplyDescrGroup><supplyDescr id="sup-0001"><name>Lint-free cloth</name><supplyRef supplyNumber="LINT-FREE-CLOTH" supplyNumberType="sp05"/><reqQuantity>As required</reqQuantity></supplyDescr></supplyDescrGroup></reqSupplies><reqSpares><noSpares/></reqSpares><reqSafety><safetyRqmts><caution><warningAndCautionPara>Do not let dirt into the reservoir. Dirt in the hydraulic oil can cause damage to the pump and the valves.</warningAndCautionPara></caution></safetyRqmts></reqSafety></preliminaryRqmts><mainProcedure><proceduralStep><para>Clean the filler-breather cap and the area around it with a lint-free cloth.</para></proceduralStep><proceduralStep><para>Turn the filler-breather cap counterclockwise and remove it.</para></proceduralStep><proceduralStep><para>Put a clean lint-free cloth over the filler opening to keep out dirt.</para></proceduralStep></mainProcedure><closeRqmts><reqCondGroup><reqCondDm><reqCond>Install a new filler-breather cap.</reqCond><dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="VH15" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="10" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="04" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="720" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></reqCondDm></reqCondGroup></closeRqmts></procedure>
